---
import Site from '../../layouts/Site.astro';
---

<Site
	title="Launching a brand and platform in under 90 days · Steven Vanden Heuvel"
	description="As Creative Director at MTG, I designed the brand, magazine, enewsletters, and responsive news site for Alt-Meat as one system, from a standing start in under three months."
>
	<section class="cs-hero">
		<div class="cs-hero__inner">
			<a class="cs-back-top" href="/#work">← Case studies</a>
			<p class="eyebrow">Case study</p>
			<h1 class="cs-hero__title display">Launching a brand and platform in under 90 days</h1>
			<p class="cs-hero__lede">MTG needed a complete editorial product for alternative proteins, live on January 1. Brand, magazine, enewsletters, and a responsive site, from a standing start.</p>
			<dl class="cs-meta">
				<div><dt>Role</dt><dd>Creative Director</dd></div>
				<div><dt>Org</dt><dd>MTG Media Group</dd></div>
				<div><dt>Recognition</dt><dd>Launched January 2021</dd></div>
			</dl>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt section--figure">
		<div class="section__inner">
			<div class="cs-figure" data-animate="fade">
				<img class="theme-img theme-img--dark" src="/images/case-studies/alt-meat/alt-meat-hero.jpg" alt="Alt-Meat site and editorial across devices" />
				<img class="theme-img theme-img--light" src="/images/case-studies/alt-meat/alt-meat-hero-light.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">What was unclear</p>
				<p class="cs-block__lede">A whole editorial brand, from nothing, in three months.</p>
				<p>MTG wanted to own the alternative protein beat with a full product, ready on January 1. There was no brand, no templates, and no site. Identity, a print magazine, an enewsletter system, and a responsive news site all had to exist and agree with each other by the deadline.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">What I led</p>
				<p class="cs-block__lede">One identity system, four products, on time.</p>
				<p>I designed the brand identity, the magazine, the enewsletter system, and the responsive news site as one connected system. The visual language carries MTG's editorial discipline so Alt-Meat reads as a peer to the company's other titles, with a typographic voice tuned for a younger industry audience.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">Who it was for</p>
				<p class="cs-block__lede">A newer, younger audience across the protein industry.</p>
				<p>Alt-Meat covered plant-based, cultivated, fermentation, and blended products for an audience entering a fast-moving field. The system gave editors article, profile, and category templates they could publish from quickly, and it was built to live alongside Meatingplace and the rest of MTG's B2B titles.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">What changed</p>
				<p class="cs-block__lede">MTG launched a new title on schedule, as one coherent brand.</p>
			</div>
			<ul class="cs-awards">
				<li><span class="cs-awards__mark">★</span><span>Launched January 2021</span></li>
				<li><span class="cs-awards__mark">★</span><span>Brand, print magazine, enewsletter system, and responsive site shipped together</span></li>
				<li><span class="cs-awards__mark">★</span><span>Designed start to finish in under three months</span></li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt">
		<div class="section__inner cs-back">
			<a class="btn" href="/work/blackbird">← Project Blackbird</a>
			<a class="btn btn--primary" href="/work/meatingplace">Next: Meatingplace →</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</Site>

<style>
	.cs-hero { max-width: var(--max); margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--space-2xl) var(--gutter); }
	.cs-back-top { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); color: var(--text-mute); font-size: var(--text-body-sm); }
	.cs-back-top:hover { color: var(--lime); }
	.cs-hero__title { margin: var(--space-xs) 0 var(--space-lg); max-width: 20ch; }
	.cs-hero__lede { font-size: var(--text-deck); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.5; max-width: 56ch; margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl); font-weight: 500; }
	.cs-meta { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: var(--space-md); margin: 0; padding: var(--space-lg) 0 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
	.cs-meta div { margin: 0; }
	.cs-meta dt { font-size: var(--text-label); letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-mute); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs); }
	.cs-meta dd { margin: 0; color: var(--text); font-size: var(--text-body); font-weight: 500; }

	.cs-figure { max-width: 75%; margin: 0 auto; }
	.cs-figure img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }

	.cs-body { display: grid; gap: var(--space-2xl); max-width: var(--max-narrow); }
	.cs-block .eyebrow { margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); }
	.cs-block__lede { color: var(--text); font-size: 28px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0 0 var(--space-md); letter-spacing: -0.015em; line-height: 1.2; }
	.cs-block p { color: var(--text); margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; }
	.cs-block p + p { margin-top: var(--space-sm); }

	.cs-awards { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 0; }
	.cs-awards li { display: flex; gap: var(--space-md); align-items: center; padding: var(--space-md) 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); font-size: 18px; }
	.cs-awards li:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
	.cs-awards__mark { color: var(--lime); font-size: 22px; min-width: 24px; }

	.cs-back { display: flex; gap: var(--space-sm); flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }

	@media (max-width: 880px) {
		.section--figure { padding: 0 24px; }
		.cs-figure { max-width: 100%; }
		.cs-hero__title { font-size: clamp(32px, 9vw, 56px); }
	}
	@media (max-width: 700px) {
		.cs-meta { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
	}
</style>
